name: Moving files changes both source boundaries across revisions
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/coverage_source_moves.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME prepare
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 15 LOGS | settled-logs
submit: run coverage:sweep {"writeSkips":true}
require-live-snap: 25 3 changed | move-check
require-live-snap: 15 1 skip row(s) | unchanged-only
require-live-snap: 15 departed · scan · source changed: 1 path(s) | source-boundary
require-live-snap: 15 arrived · scan · source changed: 1 path(s) | destination-boundary
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/coverage_source_moves.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME checked
nav-mode:
keys: z
require-live-snap: 20 READ TRANSCRIPT | reader
keys: End
live-snap: result-120x36
resize: 160x48
live-snap: result-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: result-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: result-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: result-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: result-40x12
keys: Home
live-snap: result-head-40x12
keys: End
live-snap: result-tail-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: result-page-01-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: result-page-02-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: result-page-03-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: result-page-04-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: result-page-05-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: result-page-06-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: result-page-07-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: result-page-08-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: result-page-09-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: result-page-10-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: result-page-11-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: result-page-12-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: result-page-13-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: result-page-14-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/coverage_source_moves.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME compact
ask: Do the source and destination both read as changed, while only the untouched scope receives a skip and finding fixes remain unverified?
ask: Are the revision identities, result counts and historical meaning understandable across all six sizes, including paging at 40 columns?
keys: q
resize: 120x36
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: run coverage:sweep {}
wait: 0.5
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 3 changed | recovered-move
require-live-snap: 15 departed · scan · source changed: 1 path(s) | recovered-source-boundary
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/coverage_source_moves.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME restarted
ask: Does no-color restart preserve both changed boundaries, the original baselines and the one explicit skip without starting scan work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
